00:09:10,210 --> 00:09:15,750
So speaking about breads now, there is some particular ingredients that we don't mention in the dialogue, obviously.

203
00:09:15,830 --> 00:09:20,970
But they're worth mentioning, what is the one main characteristic that most breads have?

204
00:09:21,590 --> 00:09:22,150
Yeast.

205
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:23,640
Yeast.

206
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:24,640
That's right.

207
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:25,640
Y-E-A-S-T.

208
00:09:25,690 --> 00:09:25,930
Yeast.

209
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:27,920
And yeast is actually alive.

210
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:28,450
It's an animal.

211
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:29,530
It's like a bacteria.

212
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:30,330
That's right.

213
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:37,400
And so you wonder why are some breads flat and why are some breads big, poofy, large?

214
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,920
Well, yeast is why.

215
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:45,400
Basically, you can't have a big poofy bread, a big, large, tall bread, unless you have this yeast.

216
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:48,390
So yeast is what makes the bread rise.

217
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,040
Yes.

218
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:56,050
